Oh, by the way... here's how I killed Medusa - it's not
recommended.  Located a likely "@" on level 26.  This
must be her!  Put a dot on the screen with a marker so I
can find her.  I'm in a corridor, one step from a door,
and Medusa's in line with the door, like this:

       -------
       | @   #@##
       |     |

I can't see into the room yet, and she's probably asleep
anyway.  So, I send in several magic missile and fireball
blasts from spell and wands.  Cautiously venture into the
doorway, mirror ready, just in case.  The room is dark.
Gingerly, one step at a time, move to where she was.
Noboby's there!  Whew.  But hey, where's the corpse?
Uh-oh...
Move a step back towards the door, and...
    You gaze upon Medusa -more-
    You turn to stone! -more-
    But wait!  Your amulet of life saving glows for a moment...
-more-
    You survived that attempt on your life.

Lucky about that.  I then #applied my mirror and finished
the bitch off.  Remind me to find a blindfold next time.

p.s. the spoilers list Medusa as stone resistant!  How
come the mirror works then?

